00:01:33.390 --> 00:01:35.775
But yeah, Group 80 basically, uh,

00:01:35.775 --> 00:01:38.955
stacked p- pp- PMI,

00:01:38.955 --> 00:01:41.250
t-tests, retrofitting on WordNet,

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:44.195
and in autoEncoder, and they got the highest score.

00:01:44.195 --> 00:01:45.950
